        {
          "id": "constraints", "heading": "制約・注意", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "サブスクリプションで有効化するには、パブリック プレビュー フォームの提出が必要", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/expressroute/resiliency-model", "locator": "始める前の準備", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-25T22:32:57Z" }] },
            { "text": "マルチホームでは、最低限の冗長性を損なう接続の削除がブロックされる", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/expressroute/resiliency-model", "locator": "ゲートウェイ接続を削除してください", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-25T22:32:57Z" }] },
            { "text": "プレビュー機能は、明記がない限り本番ワークロード向けではない", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/lifecycle/faq/azure-infrastructure", "locator": "Public preview", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-25T22:32:57Z" }] }
